1
00:04:28,571 --> 00:04:34,571
Komodo vs. Cobra is a horror, science fiction, tv
movie film directed by Jim Wynorski.

2
00:08:57,142 --> 00:09:03,142
A team of environmentalists, including a reporter, her camera man, and an environmentalist's
famous girlfriend charter a boat and with the captain, sail to a military island.

3
00:13:25,714 --> 00:13:31,714
They suspect the island is hosting to illegal activities.

4
00:17:54,285 --> 00:18:00,285
Upon arrival, however, they find no one.

5
00:22:22,857 --> 00:22:28,857
They finally reach a deserted house, where they find Dr.

6
00:26:51,428 --> 00:26:57,428
Susan Richardson, who tells them that everyone on the
island is dead, including her father.

7
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:26,000
Richardson's team were working on a compound that could make edible plants grow to
super size, however the military intervened with plans of their own.

8
00:35:48,571 --> 00:35:54,571
They wanted to test the compound's effects on animals, and
proceeded to feed it to several komodo dragons and cobras.

9
00:40:17,142 --> 00:40:23,142
Capt. Michael A. Stoddard, played by Michael Paré.

10
00:44:45,714 --> 00:44:51,714
Dr. Susan Richardson, played by Michelle Borth.

11
00:49:14,285 --> 00:49:20,285
Jerry Ryan, played by Ryan McTavish.

12
00:53:42,857 --> 00:53:48,857
Carrie Evans, played by Renee Talbert.

13
00:58:11,428 --> 00:58:17,428
Sandra Crescent, played by Jerri Manthey.

14
01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:46,000
Ted, played by Ted Monte.

15
01:07:08,571 --> 01:07:14,571
Cobra, also referred to as KVC, is a 2005 American
television film directed by Jim Wynorski.

16
01:11:37,142 --> 01:11:43,142
It is Wynorski's sequel to his 2004 film Curse of the Komodo.

17
01:16:05,714 --> 01:16:11,714
Wynroski says the first film "all turned out rather fun; so
much so that they asked me to do a sequel.

18
01:20:34,285 --> 01:20:40,285
I said I would do it provided they sent myself and the entire
cast to Hawaii to film it…which they did."

19
01:25:02,857 --> 01:25:08,857
The film explores themes of island, giant snake,
scientist, giant animal, komodo dragon.

20
01:29:31,428 --> 01:29:37,428
The tone is dark and thought_provoking.
